</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Speak, O blessed Master,</l><l>In this quiet hour;</l><l>Let me see Thy face, Lord,</l><l>Feel Thy touch of power.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>For the words Thou speakest,</l><l>They are life indeed;</l><l>Living bread from heaven,</l><l>Now my spirit feed!</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>All to Thee is yielded,</l><l>I am not my own;</l><l>Blissful, glad surrender,</l><l>I am Thine alone.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>Speak, Thy servant heareth,</l><l>Be not silent, Lord;</l><l>Waits my soul upon Thee</l><l>For the quickening word.</l></lg>
<lg label="6."><l>Fill me with the knowledge</l><l>Of Thy glorious will;</l><l>All Thine own good pleasure</l><l>In Thy child fulfill.</l></lg>
<lg label="7."><l>Like a watered garden,</l><l>Full of fragrance rare,</l><l>Lingering in Thy presence,</l><l>Let my life appear.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
